{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Runics is a tower defense game with auto chess and Rougelite flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is inspired by &lt;Infinitode&gt;, &lt;auto chess&gt;, &lt;Teamfight Tactics&gt; and &lt;The Tower&gt;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 unique runic options: you can use up to 50 runics with different runics with different skills and kind effects, trying your best to best infinite enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Building system: Every &quot;Runic&quot; can get another skill by equipping an item, and runic can be sacrificed into an equippable item with its own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Namely, all runics can combine their abilities, getting infinite effect combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rougelite gameplay: Each time upgrade player or best a boss gives an unique relic option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Out-of-combat scaling: Collecting resources in combat, to upgrade the huge tech tree and base. Also use stars got from level passes to purchase powerful mechanic upgrades!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623910?t=1744830815","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623910?t=1744830815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623910/9b179b627ee597bcbb3a1547d06a3aeacb6c731b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744830815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623910/9b179b627ee597bcbb3a1547d06a3aeacb6c731b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744830815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Runics is a tower defense game with auto chess and Rougelite flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is inspired by &lt;Infinitode&gt;, &lt;auto chess&gt;, &lt;Teamfight Tactics&gt; and &lt;The Tower&gt;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 unique runic options: you can use up to 50 runics with different runics with different skills and kind effects, trying your best to best infinite enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Building system: Every &quot;Runic&quot; can get another skill by equipping an item, and runic can be sacrificed into an equippable item with its own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Namely, all runics can combine their abilities, getting infinite effect combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rougelite gameplay: Each time upgrade player or best a boss gives an unique relic option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Out-of-combat scaling: Collecting resources in combat, to upgrade the huge tech tree and base. Also use stars got from level passes to purchase powerful mechanic upgrades!</p>","developers":["Alexa Gaming"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623910/a53df4513e964b26c274930a41a63ed8d775ee10/header.jpg?t=1744830815","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121299,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121299/movie480.mp4?t=1744377813","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121299/movie_max.mp4?t=1744377813"},"name":"\u7b26\u7075 \u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121299/aff62aa80d31c5938dbf2ee87d5f00a68844109c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744377813","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121299/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744377813","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121299/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744377813"}}],"name":"The Runics","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<stro